desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "源码匹配：检测到 AWS 凭据"
	title_zh: "检测到 AWS 凭据"
	type: vuln
	level: ""
	rule_id: "source-secrets-detected-amazon-mws-auth-token"
	risk: "hardcoded-credentials"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 AWS 相关的硬编码凭据。本规则合并了 4 类凭据检测：Amazon MWS 认证令牌、AWS AppSync GraphQL 密钥、AWS_SESSION_TOKEN、AWS 账号编号。凭据提交到仓库后，任何获取源码的人都能直接使用。

### 风险类型
硬编码凭据（hardcoded-credentials）

### 影响
代码中直接写入账号、令牌等敏感凭据，泄露后攻击者可直接使用这些凭据访问 AWS 服务。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合 AWS 凭据格式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE-798
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
移除硬编码凭据，改用环境变量或密钥管理服务（如 Vault、云厂商 KMS/HSM）提供凭据，并立即轮换已泄露的凭据。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.sample": <<<POS
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-secrets-detected-amazon-mws-auth-token
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-secrets-detected-aws-appsync-graphql-key
AWS_SESSION_TOKEN=AZaZaZaZaZaZaZaZ/+=
aws_account_id=123456789012
POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
AWS_REGION=us-east-1
aws_region=us-east-1
NEG
)

${*}.pattern_regex(/(?:amzn\.mws\.[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12})|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-secrets\-detected\-amazon\-mws\-auth\-token/) as $p0_0
$p0_0 as $hit_0
alert $hit_0 for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "检测到 Amazon MWS 认证令牌",
	title_zh: "检测到 Amazon MWS 认证令牌",
	message: "检测到 Amazon MWS 认证令牌",
}

${*}.pattern_regex(/(?:da2-[a-z0-9]{26})|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-secrets\-detected\-aws\-appsync\-graphql\-key/) as $p0_1
$p0_1 as $hit_1
alert $hit_1 for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "检测到 AWS AppSync GraphQL 密钥",
	title_zh: "检测到 AWS AppSync GraphQL 密钥",
	message: "检测到 AWS AppSync GraphQL 密钥",
}

${*}.pattern_regex(/(?i)AWS_SESSION_TOKEN\s*[:=]\s*[\"']?[A-Za-z0-9+=]{16,}/) as $hit_2
alert $hit_2 for {
	level: "high",
	title: "源码扫描：AWS_SESSION_TOKEN",
	title_zh: "源码扫描：AWS_SESSION_TOKEN",
	message: "源码扫描：AWS_SESSION_TOKEN",
	risk: "hardcoded-credentials",
}

${*}.pattern_regex(/(?i)aws_account_id\s*[:=]\s*[\"']?[0-9]{12}/) as $hit_3
alert $hit_3 for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "源码扫描：AWS 账号编号",
	title_zh: "源码扫描：AWS 账号编号",
	message: "源码扫描：AWS 账号编号",
	risk: "hardcoded-credentials",
}
